	"Sorot perlengkapan atau bahan untuk melihat keterangannya. Beli dan tempa di pandai besi.": "Highlight gear or materials to see details. Buy and enhance at a blacksmith.",
	"%s %s: kosong. Pandai besi menjual perlengkapan untuk tiap tokoh.": "%s slot of %s: empty. Blacksmiths sell gear for each character.",
	"\nSifat: %s": "\nTrait: %s",
	"\nBelum punya sifat. Menempa berpeluang memberinya sifat.": "\nNo trait yet. Enhancing has a chance to grant one.",

	# ------------------------------------------------------------ nama NPC dan toko
	"Tetua Bram": "Elder Bram",
	"Tetua Elowen": "Elder Elowen",
	"Tetua Aldric": "Elder Aldric",
	"Bengkel Garrick": "Garrick's Smithy",
	"Tungku Halvard": "Halvard's Forge",
	"Tungku Varek": "Varek's Forge",
	"Warung Nessa": "Nessa's Stall",
	"Lapak Tobin": "Tobin's Stand",

	# ------------------------------------------------------------ cerita: adegan
	"Negeri Aveloria telah lama damai, sampai Raja Monster bangkit di Kastil Kelam di ujung timur.": "The land of Aveloria knew peace for a long time, until the Monster King rose in Gloom Castle at the far eastern edge.",
	"Sejak itu monster berkeliaran di padang dan hutan, dan jalan antarwilayah dijaga anak buahnya.": "Since then monsters roam the fields and forests, and his minions guard the roads between regions.",
	"Di Desa Rindu, seorang ksatria muda bernama Arlen bersiap memulai perjalanannya.": "In Willowmere Village, a young knight named Arlen prepares to set out on his journey.",
	"Sebelum berangkat, aku harus pamit dulu pada Tetua Bram. Rumahnya di barat laut desa.": "Before I leave, I should say goodbye to Elder Bram. His house is in the northwest of the village.",
	"Terima kasih, Arlen. Kalau sendirian, aku pasti sudah celaka.": "Thank you, Arlen. On my own, I would have been done for.",
	"Tetua pasti cemas... tapi aku tidak mau pulang hanya untuk menunggu. Izinkan aku ikut perjalananmu.": "The Elder must be worried... but I don't want to go home just to wait. Let me join your journey.",
	"Dengan senang hati. Penyembuh sepertimu sangat kubutuhkan.": "Gladly. A healer like you is exactly what I need.",
	"Mira kini ikut bertarung. Jurus Pulih miliknya memulihkan HP seorang rekan.": "Mira now fights alongside you. Her Heal skill restores one ally's HP.",
	"Geraman dari dalam gua itu... Terlalu berbahaya kalau sendirian. Aku harus mencari rekan dulu.": "That growl from inside the cave... It's too dangerous alone. I need to find a companion first.",
	"Ogre Penjaga tumbang, dan gerbang timur pun terbuka.": "The Ogre Warden falls, and the east gate opens.",
	"Kita berhasil! Ayo kabari Tetua Bram sebelum menyeberang.": "We did it! Let's tell Elder Bram before we cross.",
	"Kabut tipis menyelimuti pepohonan. Udara di sini terasa lebih dingin.": "A thin mist shrouds the trees. The air feels colder here.",
	"Hati-hati, Arlen. Monster di Hutan Kabut jauh lebih kuat daripada di lembah.": "Be careful, Arlen. The monsters of the Mistwood are far stronger than those in the vale.",
	"Kata Tetua ada dusun kecil di tepi jalan ini. Kita cari tempat berteduh dulu.": "The Elder said there's a small hamlet along this road. Let's find shelter first.",
	"Lumayan juga kalian. Aku berutang satu.": "Not bad, you two. I owe you one.",
	"Sumber kabut ini adalah Ratu Laba-laba di rimba timur. Jaringnya menutup sarang, tapi apiku bisa membakarnya.": "The source of this mist is the Spider Queen in the eastern thicket. Her webs seal the nest, but my fire can burn them.",
	"Kami sedang menuju Kastil Kelam. Ikutlah dengan kami.": "We're headed for Gloom Castle. Come with us.",
	"Melawan Raja Monster? ...Baiklah. Aku ingin tahu sejauh apa sihirku bisa melangkah.": "Against the Monster King? ...Very well. I want to see how far my magic can go.",
	"Selene kini ikut bertarung. Bola Api membakar musuh, dan Lemahkan meruntuhkan DEF mereka.": "Selene now fights alongside you. Fireball burns enemies, and Weaken breaks their DEF.",
	"Jaring tebal menutup mulut sarang. Pedang Arlen terpental saat mencoba memotongnya.": "Thick webs seal the mouth of the nest. Arlen's sword bounces off when he tries to cut them.",
	"Tidak mempan. Jaring seperti ini harus dibakar.": "No use. Webs like these have to be burned.",
	"Ratu Laba-laba tumbang. Kabut yang menyelimuti hutan perlahan menipis.": "The Spider Queen falls. The mist shrouding the forest slowly thins.",
	"Akhirnya langit terlihat lagi. Sudah berbulan-bulan dusun ini tidak melihat matahari.": "At last the sky is visible again. This hamlet hasn't seen the sun in months.",
	"Celah Abu di timur pasti sudah bisa dilewati. Dari sana jalan menuju Pegunungan Abu.": "The Ash Pass to the east must be clear now. From there the road leads to the Ashen Mountains.",
	"Udara panas dan berbau belerang. Abu halus turun dari langit seperti salju kelabu.": "The air is hot and smells of sulfur. Fine ash drifts from the sky like grey snow.",
	"Pegunungan Abu. Gunung api di timur itu tidak pernah benar-benar tidur.": "The Ashen Mountains. That volcano to the east never truly sleeps.",
	"Para pemburu punya pos di tengah lembah ini. Kita ikuti jalan setapaknya.": "The hunters keep an outpost in the middle of this valley. Let's follow the trail.",
	"Bidikan kalian lumayan, untuk orang lembah.": "Your aim isn't bad, for valley folk.",
	"Raksasa Lahar itulah yang membuat gunung ini mengamuk. Selama dia hidup, jalan ke Kastil Kelam tertutup lahar.": "The Lava Giant is what makes this mountain rage. As long as it lives, lava blocks the road to Gloom Castle.",
	"Kami memang menuju ke sana.": "That's exactly where we're going.",
	"Kalau begitu panahku ikut. Sudah lama aku ingin membidik sesuatu yang lebih besar dari elang.": "Then my bow comes along. I've long wanted to aim at something bigger than a hawk.",
	"Kael kini ikut bertarung. Ia yang tercepat di party; Bidik Jitu dan Panah Racun adalah andalannya.": "Kael now fights alongside you. He is the fastest in the party; Sure Shot and Poison Arrow are his specialties.",
	"Jembatan batu menuju kawah runtuh. Di seberang jurang terlihat tuas pemberat jembatan cadangan.": "The stone bridge to the crater has collapsed. Across the chasm you can see the counterweight lever of a spare bridge.",
	"Terlalu jauh untuk sihirku, dan apiku hanya akan menghanguskan talinya. Kita butuh pemanah.": "It's too far for my magic, and my fire would only scorch the rope. We need an archer.",
	"Raksasa Lahar runtuh menjadi bongkahan batu dingin. Aliran lahar di timur perlahan mengeras.": "The Lava Giant crumbles into cold boulders. The lava flow to the east slowly hardens.",
	"Jalan ke timur terbuka. Di ujungnya, Kastil Kelam.": "The road east is open. At its end, Gloom Castle.",
	"Tinggal satu langkah lagi.": "Just one more step.",
	"Gerbang Kastil Kelam terbuka sendiri. Di dalam, obor-obor biru menyala tanpa minyak.": "The gate of Gloom Castle opens by itself. Inside, blue torches burn without oil.",
	"Sepi. Aku tidak suka tempat yang terlalu sepi.": "Quiet. I don't like places that are too quiet.",
	"Karpet merah ini langsung menuju ruang takhta. Dia tidak merasa perlu bersembunyi.": "This red carpet leads straight to the throne room. He doesn't feel the need to hide.",
	"Aku merasakan cahaya di aula depan. Mungkin ada altar. Kita pulihkan diri dulu sebelum naik.": "I sense light in the front hall. There may be an altar. Let's recover before we go up.",
	"Sebuah altar tua memancarkan cahaya biru lembut. Entah bagaimana, kegelapan kastil tidak menyentuhnya.": "An old altar gives off a soft blue light. Somehow, the castle's darkness does not touch it.",
	"Berdoa di altar": "Pray at the altar",
	"Cahaya menyelimuti party. HP dan MP pulih sepenuhnya. Permainan disimpan.": "Light envelops the party. HP and MP are fully restored. Game saved.",
	"Lewat saja": "Walk past",
	"Raja Monster roboh. Kegelapan yang menyelimuti Kastil Kelam luruh seperti kabut pagi.": "The Monster King collapses. The darkness over Gloom Castle melts away like morning mist.",
	"Sudah selesai.": "It's over.",
	"Tetua Bram pasti tidak percaya waktu kita ceritakan semua ini.": "Elder Bram will never believe it when we tell him all this.",
	"Aku akan menuliskannya. Harus ada yang mencatat betapa cerobohnya kalian bertarung.": "I'll write it down. Someone has to record how recklessly you all fight.",
	"Catat juga siapa yang paling sering mengenai sasaran.": "Then also record who hit the mark most often.",
	"Monster-monster menghilang dari padang dan hutan. Jalan-jalan Aveloria kembali ramai.": "The monsters vanish from the fields and forests. The roads of Aveloria are busy once more.",
	"Dan empat sahabat itu pulang, melewati gunung, hutan, dan lembah yang kini damai.": "And the four friends head home, across mountains, forests, and a valley now at peace.",

	# ------------------------------------------------------------ cerita: Desa Rindu
	"Kalian mengalahkan Ogre Penjaga! Seluruh desa berutang budi pada kalian.": "You defeated the Ogre Warden! The whole village is in your debt.",
	"Di seberang gerbang timur terbentang Hutan Kabut. Konon seorang penyihir bernama Selene tinggal di sana.": "Beyond the east gate lies the Mistwood. They say a mage named Selene lives there.",
	"Syukurlah Mira selamat. Berdua, kalian punya harapan.": "Thank goodness Mira is safe. Together, you two stand a chance.",
	"Ogre Penjaga bersarang di ujung jalan utara. Selama dia hidup, gerbang timur tetap tertutup.": "The Ogre Warden lairs at the end of the north road. As long as it lives, the east gate stays shut.",
	"Jangan terburu-buru. Berlatihlah dulu di padang, dan beristirahatlah di penginapan Marla.": "Don't rush. Train in the fields first, and rest at Marla's inn.",
	"Dan jangan menghadapinya dengan tangan kosong. Garrick, pandai besi di sisi timur desa, bisa membuatkan senjata dan zirah untuk kalian berdua.": "And don't face it empty-handed. Garrick, the blacksmith on the east side of the village, can make weapons and armor for you both.",
	"Mira pergi ke tepi hutan di utara. Keluar dari desa, lalu ikuti padang ke arah utara.": "Mira went to the forest's edge in the north. Leave the village, then follow the fields northward.",
	"Arlen. Jadi hari ini kau berangkat.": "Arlen. So today you set out.",
	"Gerbang timur dijaga Ogre, anak buah Raja Monster. Sendirian, kau tak akan sanggup melawannya.": "The east gate is guarded by an Ogre, a minion of the Monster King. Alone, you could never beat it.",
	"Mira, pendeta desa kita, pergi mencari daun penawar ke tepi hutan utara dan belum kembali. Aku cemas.": "Mira, our village cleric, went to gather remedy leaves at the northern forest's edge and has not returned. I am worried.",
	"Tolong cari dia. Jalan tanah aman dari monster; padang dan hutan tidak.": "Please find her. Dirt roads are safe from monsters; fields and forests are not.",
	"Selamat beristirahat. (HP dan MP seluruh party pulih. Permainan disimpan.)": "Rest well. (The whole party's HP and MP are restored. Game saved.)",
	"Emasmu belum cukup? Ah, untuk ksatria desa sendiri, malam ini gratis.": "Not enough gold? Ah, for our own village knight, tonight is free.",
	"HP dan MP seluruh party pulih. Permainan disimpan.": "The whole party's HP and MP are restored. Game saved.",
	"Selamat datang di Penginapan Rindu. Menginap semalam %d emas.": "Welcome to the Willowmere Inn. One night is %d gold.",
	"Menginap": "Stay the night",
	"Tidak sekarang": "Not now",
	"Mampirlah kalau lelah.": "Drop by when you're tired.",
	"Kak Mira hebat, ya! Lukaku waktu jatuh dulu langsung sembuh.": "Mira is amazing! When I fell and got hurt, she healed me right away.",
	"Kak Arlen! Kata Ayah, monster cuma muncul di rumput dan hutan. Di jalan tanah aman!": "Arlen! Dad says monsters only show up in grass and forests. Dirt roads are safe!",
	"Tapi di hutan ada serigala. Jangan ke sana sendirian, ya.": "But there are wolves in the forest. Don't go there alone, okay?",
	"Gerbang terbuka, kiriman dari timur datang lagi! Silakan lihat daganganku.": "The gate is open and shipments from the east are coming again! Have a look at my wares.",
	"Hati-hati di Hutan Kabut.": "Be careful in the Mistwood.",
	"Kiriman dari timur tertahan sejak Ogre itu menutup gerbang. Tapi ramuan racikanku sendiri masih ada.": "Shipments from the east have been stuck since that Ogre closed the gate. But I still have potions of my own making.",
	"Kalau gerbangnya terbuka lagi, daganganku akan lebih lengkap.": "Once the gate opens again, I'll have more in stock.",
	"Mau berangkat tanpa zirah? Sini, kubuatkan yang pas untuk tiap orang.": "Setting out without armor? Come here, I'll make something that fits each of you.",
	"Bawakan juga bahan dari monster. Dengan itu perlengkapanmu bisa kutempa lebih kuat, dan kadang muncul sifat istimewa.": "Bring me monster materials too. With those I can enhance your gear, and sometimes a special trait appears.",
	"Jaga baik-baik barang buatanku.": "Take good care of my work.",
	"Arlen! Syukurlah kau datang. Aku sedang mencari daun penawar, tapi...": "Arlen! Thank goodness you came. I was looking for remedy leaves, but...",
	"Awas, di belakangmu! Serigala!": "Watch out, behind you! Wolves!",
	"Mira bergabung dengan party!": "Mira joined the party!",

	# ------------------------------------------------------------ cerita: Dusun Embun
	"Baja dusun ini ditempa dengan embun pagi. Lebih kuat daripada besi lembah.": "This hamlet's steel is forged with morning dew. It is stronger than valley iron.",
	"Benang laba-laba dan bara roh kabut adalah bahan tempa yang bagus. Jangan dibuang.": "Spider thread and mist wraith embers make fine enhancing materials. Don't throw them away.",
	"Kabutnya menipis! Sudah lama sekali aku tidak melihat cahaya sejernih ini.": "The mist is thinning! It has been so long since I saw light this clear.",
	"Celah Abu di ujung timur kini terbuka. Di baliknya Pegunungan Abu, lalu Kastil Kelam.": "The Ash Pass at the eastern end is open now. Beyond it lie the Ashen Mountains, then Gloom Castle.",
	"Selene selamat. Syukurlah.": "Selene is safe. Thank goodness.",
	"Sarang Ratu Laba-laba ada di rimba timur. Gigitannya beracun dan jaringnya melambatkan; bawalah Penawar.": "The Spider Queen's nest is in the eastern thicket. Her bite poisons and her webs slow you; bring Remedies.",
	"Altar tua ada di rimba utara, di tengah pepohonan paling rapat.": "The old altar is in the northern thicket, where the trees grow thickest.",
	"Pendatang dari lembah? Jarang ada yang sampai ke Dusun Embun sejak gerbang ditutup.": "Travelers from the vale? Few have reached Dewfall Hamlet since the gate was shut.",
	"Kabut ini bukan kabut biasa. Ia datang sejak Ratu Laba-laba bersarang di rimba timur.": "This is no ordinary mist. It came when the Spider Queen made her nest in the eastern thicket.",
	"Selene, penyihir muda dusun ini, pergi ke altar tua di rimba utara mencari cara mengusirnya. Sudah tiga hari belum kembali.": "Selene, this hamlet's young mage, went to the old altar in the northern thicket to find a way to drive it off. She has been gone three days.",
	"Kalau kalian memang hendak ke timur, tolong cari dia.": "If you really are heading east, please look for her.",
	"Tidurlah yang nyenyak. (HP dan MP seluruh party pulih. Permainan disimpan.)": "Sleep soundly. (The whole party's HP and MP are restored. Game saved.)",
	"Kurang emas? Bayar saja nanti kalau kabut ini sudah hilang.": "Short on gold? Just pay me once this mist is gone.",
	"Penginapan Embun. Semalam %d emas, sudah termasuk bubur hangat.": "The Dewfall Inn. %d gold a night, warm porridge included.",
	"Pintu selalu terbuka.": "The door is always open.",
	"Mau apa, Nak? Di hutan ini Penawar lebih berharga daripada emas.": "What will it be, dear? In this forest a Remedy is worth more than gold.",
	"Awas laba-laba. Racunnya menggerogoti pelan-pelan.": "Beware the spiders. Their poison eats away at you slowly.",
	"Jangan mendekat! ...Oh, manusia. Kukira laba-laba lagi.": "Stay back! ...Oh, humans. I thought it was more spiders.",
	"Aku Selene. Jaring-jaring ini mengepungku di altar sejak kemarin, dan sihirku hampir habis.": "I'm Selene. These webs have had me trapped at the altar since yesterday, and my magic is nearly spent.",
	"Tetua Elowen meminta kami mencarimu.": "Elder Elowen asked us to find you.",
	"Kalau begitu bantu aku sekarang. Mereka datang!": "Then help me now. Here they come!",
	"Selene bergabung dengan party!": "Selene joined the party!",

	# ------------------------------------------------------------ cerita: Pos Pemburu
	"Mitril dari perut gunung. Mahal, tapi tidak ada yang lebih baik sebelum Kastil Kelam.": "Mithril from the mountain's belly. Costly, but there is nothing better before Gloom Castle.",
	"Kalau ketemu kura-kura magma, jangan lari. Cangkangnya bahan tempa langka.": "If you meet a magma tortoise, don't run. Its shell is a rare enhancing material.",
	"Gunungnya tenang. Seumur hidupku belum pernah sesunyi ini.": "The mountain is calm. In all my life it has never been this quiet.",
	"Jalan lahar di timur sudah mengeras. Kastil Kelam ada di ujungnya. Semoga langkah kalian ringan.": "The lava road to the east has hardened. Gloom Castle stands at its end. May your steps be light.",
	"Kael ikut kalian? Anak itu memang tidak betah diam.": "Kael went with you? That boy never could sit still.",
	"Raksasa Lahar berdiam di kawah timur laut. Semburannya membakar, dan hantamannya meruntuhkan pertahanan. Bawa Penawar yang banyak.": "The Lava Giant dwells in the northeastern crater. Its bursts burn, and its slams break your defense. Bring plenty of Remedies.",
	"Punggung bukit utara, di antara dua lereng berbatu. Di situ Kael biasa mengintai.": "The northern ridge, between two rocky slopes. That is where Kael usually keeps watch.",
	"Orang lembah sampai ke sini? Kalian pasti yang mengusir kabut di barat.": "Valley folk, all the way out here? You must be the ones who drove off the mist in the west.",
	"Gunung ini mengamuk sejak Raksasa Lahar bangkit di kawah. Lahar menutup satu-satunya jalan ke timur.": "This mountain has raged ever since the Lava Giant rose in the crater. Lava blocks the only road east.",
	"Kael, pemanah terbaik kami, pergi mengintainya dari punggung bukit utara. Sudah tiga hari tidak ada kabar.": "Kael, our best archer, went to scout it from the northern ridge. There has been no word for three days.",
	"Kalau kalian bertemu dia, bilang pos ini masih menunggunya.": "If you meet him, tell him this outpost is still waiting for him.",
	"Selimutnya tebal, tidurlah. (HP dan MP seluruh party pulih. Permainan disimpan.)": "The blankets are thick, get some sleep. (The whole party's HP and MP are restored. Game saved.)",
	"Tidak ada emas? Pemburu saling menolong. Masuklah.": "No gold? Hunters look out for each other. Come in.",
	"Pondok singgah para pemburu. Semalam %d emas, sup daging rusa sepuasnya.": "The hunters' lodge. %d gold a night, all the venison stew you can eat.",
	"Apinya selalu menyala.": "The fire is always lit.",
	"Bekal untuk naik gunung? Kadal bara menyulut, elang abu merobek zirah. Siapkan Penawar.": "Supplies for the climb? Ember lizards set you alight, ash hawks tear through armor. Pack Remedies.",
	"Jangan dekat-dekat lahar.": "Keep away from the lava.",
	"Ssst. Merunduk.": "Shh. Get down.",
	"Aku Kael. Tiga hari aku mengintai Raksasa Lahar dari sini... dan baru saja elang-elang itu menemukanku.": "I'm Kael. I've been watching the Lava Giant from here for three days... and those hawks have just found me.",
	"Tetua Aldric mencarimu.": "Elder Aldric is looking for you.",
	"Nanti saja ceritanya. Mereka menukik!": "Save the story for later. They're diving!",
	"Kael bergabung dengan party!": "Kael joined the party!",
}
